---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "July 25, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-500">
    Last updated: {lastUpdated}
  </p>

  <div
    class="prose prose-neutral mt-8 max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-headings:font-semibold"
  >
    <p>
      Fexer is a camera app. It does not collect, store, or transmit any
      personal data to the developer or to any third party. Everything Fexer
      does happens on your device.
    </p>

    <h2>What Fexer accesses, and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Camera</strong> — to let you take photos and videos. Frames
        are processed on-device and never leave your phone except when you
        explicitly save or share them.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Microphone</strong> — to record audio when you capture video.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Photo Library</strong> — to save the photos and videos you
        capture, and to let you view them again inside the app.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Location (When In Use)</strong> — optional. If granted, Fexer
        embeds GPS coordinates into a photo or video's own metadata, the same
        way the built-in Camera app does. Location data is never sent
        anywhere; it only ever exists inside the file on your device.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Motion &amp; Orientation</strong> — used locally to power the
        electronic level / horizon indicator in the viewfinder.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>No accounts, no analytics, no ads</h2>
    <p>
      Fexer has no user accounts, no analytics or crash-reporting SDKs, no
      advertising, and makes no network requests. There is nothing for the
      developer to see, because nothing is collected.
    </p>

    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>
      Fexer does not share data with third parties, because it does not
      collect any data to share.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Because Fexer collects no data of any kind, it does not knowingly
      collect data from children or anyone else.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy ever changes, the update will be posted on this page
      with a revised "last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:nandanvarma.me@gmail.com"
        >nandanvarma.me@gmail.com</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
